      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "nothing really new sadly. There are issues with peering between Telekom ISP and Cloudflare - but relative to how appearent they are it got a good bit worse.\n\nWhat you basicall can do at this point to potentially fix that issue for you right now:\n\n- cloudflare warp\n\n- use a vpn\n\n- restart your router/internet connection in hopes of getting a different IP address to get a different route towards the vrc servers\n\nI personally do option \"use a vpn\" for about 2 years now, since it is a reaccuring problem. Fun fact: if you have a dualstack (meaning ipv4 and ipv6) you only need to \"reroute\" ipv4 through the vpn.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
